  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/prometheus/banner.png\" alt=\"Prometheus 橫幅\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"模組載入器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔線\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus-api/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/client-server.svg\" alt=\"客戶端與伺服器\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"問題回報\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2>\n<p>本模組為希望引入自訂火焰類型的模組開發者提供了一個<strong>易於使用的 API</strong>，可無縫整合一致的行為。</p>\n<p>它正是驅動 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Fire</a> 的核心，並能與其他許多模組整合！</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ <strong>重要提示</strong>：必須在<strong>客戶端與伺服器</strong>上都安裝 Prometheus，因為它引入了實質性的遊戲玩法變更，而不僅是視覺效果。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>✨ <strong>功能特色</strong></h2>\n<h3>🛠️ <strong>全面的自訂火焰 API</strong></h3>\n<p>模組開發者與數據包創作者可以輕鬆添加自己的自訂火焰（或實作其他模組的火焰），並自動確保<strong>一致的行為表現</strong>與自訂附魔。</p>\n<p>透過詳細的文件學習如何整合自訂火焰類型並使用所提供的 API：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>📖 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API 維基</a></li>\n<li>📘 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus/wiki/Data-Driven-Fires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">數據包整合維基</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🔥 <strong>一致的火焰行為</strong></h3>\n<p>一旦將您的自訂火焰註冊到 Prometheus API，您將自動享有所有這些功能及其他更多特性！</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>🔹 <strong>自訂火焰覆蓋層</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/prometheus/overlay.gif\" alt=\"覆蓋層\"><br>\n<em>想要更纖細的版本嗎？請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/slim-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slim Fire</a>！</em></p></li>\n<li><p>⚔️ <strong>自訂火焰傷害</strong><br>\n觸及自訂火焰的生物會以正確的顏色燃燒，並每秒承受適當的傷害量！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/prometheus/damage.gif\" alt=\"傷害\"></p></li>\n<li><p>⚙️ <strong>自訂火焰屬性</strong><br>\n您可以設定光照等級、雨水是否會澆滅火焰，並將其與火把、營火、燈籠等物品關聯！</p></li>\n<li><p>🎯 <strong>自訂火焰機制</strong><br>\n例如（但不限於）被自訂火焰點燃的殭屍與箭矢，會正確地為目標施加對應的火焰效果！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/prometheus/arrows.gif\" alt=\"箭矢\"></p></li>\n<li><p>💡 <strong>自訂火焰效果</strong><br>\n您可以為火焰設定任何自訂效果，每次生物受到您的火焰傷害時都會觸發！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/prometheus/behavior.gif\" alt=\"效果\"></p></li>\n<li><p>📚 <strong>全新附魔：自訂火焰附加 & 自訂烈焰。</strong><br>\n類似於火焰附加與烈焰弓附魔，但會施加您自訂的火焰！<br>\n附魔為選用項目，可透過數據包進行設定。請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/prometheus/wiki/Server-resources#data-driven-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">數據驅動附魔</a> 以了解更多。</p></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🤝 <strong>相容性</strong></h2>\n<p>已完全整合至 Prometheus 的模組：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">載入器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Fire</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torch hit!</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/danger-close\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Danger Close</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/camp-fires-cook-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Camp Fires Cook Mobs</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>希望您的模組列在這裡嗎？請在此提交問題回報 <a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/prometheus/issues/new?assignees=Crystal-Spider&labels=question,medium priority&projects=&template=information_request.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 並提供您的模組連結！</p>\n<h2>🔗 <strong>依賴項目</strong></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">載入器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">全部</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必裝</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><strong>授權與使用權利</strong></h2>\n<p>歡迎將此模組用於任何整合包或影片中，只需確保提供署名，並可附上 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a> 的連結。<br>\n本專案採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/prometheus/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest Community License v1</a> 授權發布。</p>\n<h2><strong>支持我們</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 官網\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><img alt=\"我們的其它專案\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p></p>",
